  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0313_8b7da5c9b0a0.png\" style=\"width: 264px; height: 180px;\" /></p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;be the direction cosines of the line normal to the plane, then<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>l</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\"><mi>l</mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;The equation of the plane is<br /><br /><math><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math>it passes through<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><br />Hence, the equation of the plane is <math><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>7</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><msqrt><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><msqrt><mn>83</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
